      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انهضّ</span></b>  <i>It broke,</i> or <i>became broken:</i> (S, K:)
<i>it became bruised, brayed, pounded,</i> or <i>crushed:</i>
(S:) quasi-pass. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَضَّهُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اهتضّهُ</span>. (TA.)

